# The three local storage roots. `evidence/` was already here; the other two
# are the defaults for DERIVATIVE_ROOT and LEGACY_SOURCE_ROOT (config/settings)
# and hold extracted document text and OneNote page XML respectively. The
# production Compose file builds from this repository *on the server*, so a
# checkout that has ever run the importer would otherwise bake real source
# material into the image.
evidence/
derivatives/
legacy-source/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
